 "description": "Hand cases for the build.redactLogLine and build.redactLog rows (PL.native-build-redact-rows) beyond core's build-log redaction corpus: the private-key state carried line by line through build.redactLogLine (as a runner streaming its tools' output carries it), a null context and null context parts, both orders core pins (credentials before paths; the usual home forms before the user-name segment), and the rows' [invalid-input] boundary. Every expectation is core's own answer at the pin, computed by tools/hand-cases/build-redact.mjs through tools/gen-hand-cases.mjs.",
